MODEL

$ Synthetic conditional policy system

IDENTITY> y001
EQ> y001 = 0.35*TSLAG(y001) + 0.10*p001 + 0.01*aggregate + x001

IDENTITY> p001
EQ> p001 = 0.15*y001 + cost001

IDENTITY> cap001
EQ> cap001 = y001
IF> regime001 > 0
IDENTITY> cap001
EQ> cap001 = 0.8*y001
IF> regime001 <= 0

